# ----- gamY: Import file: c:\greu_ib\GREU\model\modules/04_energy_and_emissions_taxes.gms ----- 

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Variable, dummy and group creation
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------


# ----- gamY: IF "tests" == "variables": -----
